{"game": "aliens-fireteam-elite", "language": "english", "appid": 1549970, "month": "2025-03", "window": 1, "start_date": 1740787200, "end_date": 1741391999, "month_true_total": 97, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-04 02:24:41 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "189615577", "author": {"steamid": "76561199237877091", "personaname": "Zero_Twice_00", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199237877091/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 58, "playtime_forever": 188, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 188, "last_played": 1734070296, "avatar": "0ea62c250fe338d2ac2fdd14ccde491469ca2b87"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's chill", "timestamp_created": 1741372703, "timestamp_updated": 1741372703, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "189604866", "author": {"steamid": "76561197999685851", "personaname": "WhoopsIdiedAgain", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197999685851/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 2675, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2660, "last_played": 1781619950, "avatar": "cdff433c9ea96c9933449fa59011b1dc31a4f0a2"}, "language": "english", "review": "I actually enjoyed this game. But I also enjoy the franchise. Of course I will acknowledge the films being made, eventhough I think it may hurt the story/lore. One of the things I enjoy is the loot box you can find on each level. I wish there was more than one, but oh well. The card system they have can make the rewards feel greater, or make the levels harder if you want a challenge. I agree the AI for the allies can be improved. Constantly get in the way or block shots. A part of me feels like this game is still missing alot. It feels like it is just the bare bones of what it could be. It feels like they left room to expand on it, but never did. Overall I got my money's worth out of the game. To bad it will sit on the shelf and expire like so many other games out there.", "timestamp_created": 1741364352, "timestamp_updated": 1741364352, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "189572952", "author": {"steamid": "76561199574885785", "personaname": "vmarck", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199574885785/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 916, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 916, "last_played": 1741333779, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Loved the story, the gameplay, the locations, the music... I'm not gonna lie, I'm a casual gamer, but since this franchise mean a lot to me since my childhood, it's like a dream come true of a game. Hope you get to enjoy it as much as I do, think I would have loved to have more campaigns as technically you only get 3 + 1 available for purchase on DLC (which I bought and liked).", "timestamp_created": 1741333999, "timestamp_updated": 1741333999, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "189479583", "author": {"steamid": "76561199695749795", "personaname": "TheWanderer97", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199695749795/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 455, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 365, "last_played": 1741370010, "avatar": "2349c8efb705301af951bd072cd988b90a1d8cde"}, "language": "english", "review": "A great hoard shooter to boot, lots of customization on how to play and tons of lore accurate weaponry to play with. I love how they also revitalized one my favorite franchises to this day. Fun to play with friends.", "timestamp_created": 1741223473, "timestamp_updated": 1741223473, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "189477775", "author": {"steamid": "76561198037974346", "personaname": "Machete", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/imMachete/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 172, "playtime_forever": 919, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 786, "last_played": 1743869289, "avatar": "b1eeaf6b3555e8d32af28474a967aae980b57739"}, "language": "english", "review": "Bom para um caralho.", "timestamp_created": 1741221170, "timestamp_updated": 1741221170, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.559859156608581543", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}]}